{title: Shenandoah}
{key: C}
{time: 4/4}

{define: C base-fret 1 frets x 3 2 0 1 0}
{define: F base-fret 1 frets 1 3 3 2 1 1}

{comment: A simplified arrangement of the traditional song, every note a quarter.}

{start_of_verse: label="Verse"}
[*N.C.]Oh [C]Shenandoah [C]I long to hear [F]you
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_verse: label="Verse"}
[*N.C.]'Tis [C]seven long years [C]since last I saw [F]you
{end_of_verse}
